{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_strong_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_strong_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"将错就错","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_strong_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"557a46fdb08b45be7d0b7db37642a0560aa6bdb4414ce2db49cb07c5a3356f6b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是他？你确定没认错？这可不是闹着玩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盯了有一阵了，和传出来的消息一模一样，绝对错不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......看起来的确不太好惹的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，真要动手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"丢的这批货至关重要，由不得我们选......暗号是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，生意挺好啊，大过年的也不休息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁晚上人多，正好多做点生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，您的麻辣鳞丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，闻着就好香，老板，给你钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔......真不错，不愧是在百大民间美食攻略里特别推荐的鳞丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"怎......怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钱给多了，喏，找您钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"谢......谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我可以走了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，还有事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事！老板再见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像又吓到客人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说错什么了吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，这几天好像都是你在出摊啊，老董他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近天冷，董阿伯腿痛，我多帮帮他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大爷，您认识董阿伯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门最好的鳞丸师傅，我当然认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧路过，就照顾一下他的生意吧，给我来一份，也让我尝尝你学到了他几分手艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，您稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"四份鳞丸，三个咖喱，一个菌汤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，您稍等，我做完前面这份就做您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我说四份鳞丸，三个咖喱，一个菌汤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我记清楚了，三个咖喱，一个菌汤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么回事？！你不是说这是暗号吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（没错啊！那个菲林女杀手每次和他接头都说这个！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大爷，您的鳞丸好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好，给你钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了大爷，您是董阿伯的熟人，不好意思收您的钱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，该给的钱得给，该办的事也得办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你说对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么回事，那个老头好像在看我们？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（啧，真麻烦。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位老板......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的鳞丸还要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要是不确定要啥口味的，我给您挑两个，您先尝尝——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么这就动手了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不趁这会儿偷袭，等着他干掉我们吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"少废话！赶快把人带走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这就给卤水帮送信，说他们老大在我们手里，今晚就得拿东西来换！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，年轻人，下手要有轻重，别坏了龙门的规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"老头，这是道上的事，一般人躲远点，别多管闲事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......有意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"头好痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是怎么回事......？这是哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，你醒了。先喝杯水吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢——怎么回事，你们是谁......我怎么被绑起来了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"对您这样的大人物，用这种手段也是迫不得已。之前一直不知道卤水帮是您的人，多有得罪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但是话说回来，这次抢我们的货到底是卤水帮不对在先。您看，是不是该给个说法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么货？鳞？那渔船就在码头，最新鲜的鳞当然是谁去得早归谁，怎么就成我抢你们的了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（他说“码头”？我们的货不就是在码头被劫的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（懂了，“鳞”是黑话，他意思是说，货被谁拿到就该归谁。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......行，您说的也不是没有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"但干这行也有这行的规矩，这批货的生意一直是我们叉烧帮在做，您突然要加进来，是不是该先和我们有个商量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我开水产摊这么久了，怎么从来没见过你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（“水产摊”也是黑话？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（他意思是说，他混得比我们早，我们才是后来的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，我们当然知道，您在整个龙门也是有头有脸的人物。我们敬重您的地位，所以才和您商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"您要想做生意，我们可以谈，但是您抢去的那批货，对我们叉烧帮也很重要，大家和气生财，您就把东西还给我们吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在龙门......有头有脸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......你们好像是找错人了，能不能放我走啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，别敬酒不吃吃罚酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我们看在你的面子上和你好好说话。你也别以为我们叉烧帮是好糊弄的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我实在不知道你们在说什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还在这装傻？呵，把东西拿出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"这张照片，您还有印象吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是，槐琥小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为我们不知道，这是你们卤水帮的职业杀手，也是暗中保护你的护卫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"上个月月底那天，她来你这买了鳞丸，第二天，卤水帮的对头就被人抄了家，说是一个使古怪功夫的菲林干的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你还说她不是受你的指使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥小姐，怎么偏偏在那个时候去行侠仗义......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这张呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局的鬼姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"看来不只是我们，近卫局的人也早就盯上了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的人可不止一次在那家鳞丸摊附近看到过鬼姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是解释解释，近卫局特别任务组的督察，为什么会对一个卖鳞丸的小贩感兴趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是个误会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，别以为卤水帮替身的把戏能瞒过我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"承认吧，你们卤水帮明面上的老大不过是个傀儡，真正的老大，是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我还是先别说话了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不说话，看来是没的谈了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，不谈也罢，那就看您手下的人，到底要不要管他们的老大了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"与此同时"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"二哥，终于有老大消息了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么情况？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"叉烧帮刚送信过来，说头儿在他们手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"给了我们一个地址，让我们今晚带货物去换人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他妈的，果然是他们！把大伙都叫上，找叉烧帮算账去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我们要带货物吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"带个屁！当我们卤水帮好欺负？抄家伙！和他们拼了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑得怎么样，“老大”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"信已经送到了你们卤水帮手里。现在交出货物，我们还能和平解决，等一会儿打起来撕破脸，可就不太好收场了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怎么还送了信过去，万一对面真的派人过来可怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"好家伙，事到如今还敢威胁我们？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是这个意思——唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么办，他说的好像也有道理。万一打起来，我们人手确实不够啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（你怎么不多带点人来？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（不是你说这次要秘密行动的？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（谁能想到他真的什么都不说？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（......罢了，你先看好他，最好能逼他把东西交出来。我去多叫几个兄弟来。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑得怎么样，“老大”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"识相点，现在交出货物，我们和平解决，一会儿要是打起来撕破脸，可就真的不好收场了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能问问，你们说的“货”，到底是什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还要装傻？你们卤水帮的人在码头打伤我们好几个兄弟，就为了抢这个东西，能不知道这东西的分量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，这么危险的生意也就你们卤水帮敢和我们叉烧帮抢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，“危险”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"别装了，谁不知道这东西有多危险？敢在近卫局眼皮底下和我们抢这生意，不就是想赚笔大的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那个，现在就剩你一个人了对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，好吧，我告诉你东西到底藏在哪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？这还差不多。快说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你靠过来点，我悄悄告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再过来点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"磨磨叽叽的，真是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"董阿伯说得对，用脑袋撞人有时候比拳头还好使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这绳子绑得真紧......不好意思，这把刀先借我用用，有机会再还你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道你们到底要找谁又要找什么东西，可是你们真的找错人了，我真的不是什么老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，说了你们也不听，我还是先走吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，头好痛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"按信上写的，就是这了。叉烧帮的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看那边，有一个拿着刀的人从楼里走出来了，应该就是叉烧帮接头的人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，你们看那个人，是不是有些面熟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想起来了！他就是那个伪装成水产贩子的顶级杀手。我上次亲眼见他用一把刮鳞刀砍翻了二十个人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没想到他居然是叉烧帮的人，这下可不好办了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先别急，过去问问再说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人追出来，应该甩掉了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......大过年的，摊都没收呢，这都是什么事啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那边那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"这儿是叉烧帮的地盘吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（刚那几个人，说他们是叉烧帮的来着。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊对，这就是叉烧帮的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶恶的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶恶的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我们老大在哪？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪知道？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶恶的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，知道你们叉烧帮人多，但别以为我们卤水帮就好欺负！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们找错人了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然一下子就把二哥打倒了，不愧是叉烧帮第一杀手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还有这个版本......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕！我们这么多人，压都能压死他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大家跟我上，救出老大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......现在还是先跑路比较好吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"别让他跑了！追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，还真带着人过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟们，和他们拼了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，原来还有埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟们别怕，跟他们拼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"交出东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"交出我们老大！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你们怎么打起来了？大家有话好好说，别打架啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，唉......我还是先回去收摊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，他们说的“货”，到底是什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王阿伯，晚上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这不是孑小子么。你怎么来了，这个点可没新鲜的鳞卖你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，阿伯，我想向您打听点事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在最近，您有见过两伙人在码头打架吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"别开玩笑了，就在这码头，一天到晚打架的人比买鳞的人还多，你问的是哪一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是一般的路人打架，是那种，一看就是很坏的两伙人打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这么说也不对......阿伯，最近您在码头上见过什么生面孔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，这么大的码头，每天人来人往的，我哪能记得清？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸，不过你这么一说，我好像有点印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得上个月有一阵子，每天傍晚的时候都有人运一批箱子到码头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"要是一般送货的人我也不会在意，但是那批箱子都用黑色的布裹得严严实实，看起来还蛮奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还记得那些人的长相吗？那些箱子都送到哪去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那会儿我正忙着收摊呢，哪有功夫记这个。你当谁都像你小子一样，记性那么好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看来叉烧帮说的就是这批货物。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们到底在谋划什么......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟，刚都没注意，看你脸上这伤，又打架了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"接着，拿冰块敷一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子，明明看着挺老实，怎么总见你身上挂着伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......其实我也不想的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这么些年了，我也算了解你小子。心眼好，性子又直，见不得半点不公道。所以才总是和那些混混起冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是阿伯，那些其实都是误会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王阿伯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你是个好孩子，但你也要保护好自己。出了事自然有该管事的人，不该惹的人你千万不要惹，明白不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢您阿伯。但今晚我有必须要做的事，而且我想我知道该怎么做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了阿伯，能借您电话一用吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的叉烧帮，还挺能打......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人也真是......怎么都跑得那么快。都跑哪去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还好，看起来剩了一个没跑掉啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叉烧帮第一杀手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"饶命......饶命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才的事我姑且不和你计较。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你仔细听好了，接下来的问题，我只问一遍，如果回答不能让我满意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道会是什么下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我说！只要我知道的，我一定说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上周，卤水帮从我们这抢去的东西，现在放在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卤水帮抢我们的东西是有什么打算？准备卖给谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说不知道？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我入伙还不到两个月......帮里的那些机密，我真的是一点都不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道些什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"就在上周！在码头，帮里派人抢了叉烧帮的什么东西，老大很高兴。但是没过几天，老大就失踪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"帮里派了好多人去找，但怎么都找不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原来卤水帮的老大是真的失踪了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，然后直到今天，听说收到叉烧帮的信，我只是以为要打架了，才跟着其他人来的，别的什么我是真的不知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......好像确实问不出什么东西了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，告诉你，你们老大就在我们叉烧帮手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去告诉你们老大，不对......告诉你们帮里现在能管事的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再给你们一次和谈的机会，今晚零点，带着从我们叉烧帮抢的东西，在码头等我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次要是再看不到你们卤水帮的诚意，我们就真的要撕票了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的卤水帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看样子，他应该是相信了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"演坏人，好难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静，冷静......接下来是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"废物！饭桶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住的人还能让他给跑了，人丢了，我们拿什么和卤水帮谈判？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你还骂我？你带那么多人不也没逮住他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听说有人要找我，我来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叉烧帮众人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，该夸你们观察力不错，竟然能发现我的真实身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我就是卤水帮的老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"果然......你、你想怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很简单，卤水帮抢叉烧帮的东西，我会如数归还。但叉烧帮绑架我这件事，我也要一个说法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚零点，卤水帮会带着东西在码头等着你们。同样的，我要叉烧帮上下所有人全部到场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该还的东西我会还，可丢掉的面子，我也会找回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么办，这东西我们还敢要吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"（等、等等......他只有一个人，刚才能打晕他一次，说不定......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我看谁敢妄动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她就是那个菲林女杀手！真的是她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，刚才我大意被你们偷袭得逞了一回，你们还有胆子干第二次？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来，你们是真的不清楚，你们到底是在和什么人打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"（接下来该干嘛了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（墙，墙！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"（哦对。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"一拳就......把墙打穿了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两小时后，我在码头等着你们。要是见不到叉烧帮的人，后果自负！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"现在该怎么办......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的叉烧帮成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"还能怎么办，该来的躲不了，我们去就是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"等等等等，跑这么快干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你还没告诉我呢，为什么专门叫我来陪你演这出戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......到这里应该差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，说实话，其实到现在我也不完全清楚到底是怎么一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之先谢谢你了，下次请你吃鳞丸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"不客气，倒也没什么大不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你刚才还真挺像一个黑老大的，看得我都差点信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看上去就那么像坏人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会真的有什么秘密身份吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就别调侃我了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我还是先去码头吧，等到零点，应该一切都清楚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叉烧帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，来得挺准时啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卤水帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你们也不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叉烧帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要的东西呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卤水帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"先别急着问货，我们老大在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叉烧帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"开什么玩笑，你们卤水帮还想耍我们到什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叉烧帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"废话少说，快把抢我们的东西交出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卤水帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"做梦，先让我们见到老大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叉烧帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"简直是欺人太甚，你们还想打一架？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卤水帮","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"要打便打，还怕你们不成？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，都先把家伙放下。有什么话去局里慢慢说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叉烧帮&卤水帮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他妈的，上当了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，跟我走一趟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你报的警吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能说说，你是怎么知道这两伙人今晚在码头有交易的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，解释起来，好复杂......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有好多事情我到现在也没弄明白，但大概情况就是这样......您能相信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，不用紧张，其实这件案子，近卫局也跟了一段时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉你也无妨。其实在之前那场动乱后，好多武器遗落在龙门街头。近卫局已经尽力回收了，但还是有不少被叉烧帮这些人捡去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这岂不是很危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不过这些人倒也没直接走私武器的胆子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他们打算把这些武器上还完好的源石装置拆卸下来再卖到其他地方去。当然这种事也是违法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"前几天，近卫局抓住了卤水帮的头目，当时他正在给那批从叉烧帮手里抢来的货物找下家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙嘴还挺严，我们没问出多少东西。今晚能将这些人一网打尽，你功不可没。也真亏你能有这个主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，但话说回来，下次可不许再干这么危险的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是这样，我总算是明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警官，要是没什么事，我能走了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"实不相瞒，我也关注你好久了。我觉得凭你的本事，只在龙门当一个小摊商贩实在是有些屈才了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道有份更适合你的差事，你要不要考虑一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......谢谢您的好意，警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，龙门需要您这样的警官，也需要水产贩子，没什么屈不屈才的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我嘴笨，总之，我觉得现在没什么不好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我明白。行，我当然尊重你的选择。不过要是什么时候改了主意，随时可以来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦您了，那我就先回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等近卫局年假放完记得来领奖状！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，有空一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好小子，不愧是跟着姓董的出来的，我也算没看错人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"narration","text":"数月后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，看到那个鳞丸摊了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看起来生意不错啊，要不去尝尝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，你别以为那只是个普通鳞丸摊，摊主的真实身份，是龙门码头总舵主！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大年夜那天，他一人约战叉烧帮卤水帮两个帮派共两百多人，你猜怎么着，他一个人把两百多人全都打趴下了！而且啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！小点声，他好像听见了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，要来份鳞丸吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]}]}
